MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_001: Promised One! You made it back safe.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_002: Amazing that you fended off such a large army—\nand made it look easy! Incredible.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_003: While you were doing that, we evacuated\nthe villagers.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_004: And during the escape, we treated the injured with\nmedicinal herbs.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_005: Had to do it right away, so they didn't develop\ninfections and get stuck in bed.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_006: Oh! And I made sure to put the medicine in bottles\nso they could drink lying down, if they collapsed.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_007: <NCA>"You've done good work."
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_008: Thanks. I'm just glad to make myself useful to you\nand people in need.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_009: I've been doing volunteer rescue work ever since\nthe world became like...well, like this.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_010: But really, I've enjoyed helping others since I was a\nlittle kid.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_011: I wonder... Is there some way I can help you,\nPromised One?
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_012: <NCA>"Do I seem like I need help?"
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_013: I didn't mean that any kind of way. I'm just offering\nbecause I think I can help.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_014: I've learned a lot about medicinal herbs, so I know\nhow to treat people who are injured or sick.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_015: And I'm stronger too. There was a time, if someone\nwas trapped under rubble, I couldn't help. Not now.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_016: Ah.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_017: I never used to appreciate the arm strength I got\nfrom my mom, but it comes in handy.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_018: I guess, really, what I want is to be like you.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_019: <NCA>"This is more than starry-eyed admiration."
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_020: <NCB>"I doubt I could stop you."
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_021: <ACA>You could say that. When I joined this fight, I had\nbarely any experience. But I've learned so much.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_022: <ACB>You got that right. I'm set on it, and I won't budge\nwhatever you say.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_023: No matter what danger we get into, or how hard\nthe battles get...I'm going to help people. With you.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_024: Promised One? You're planning to survey the\nvillage outskirts, aren't you?
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_025: <NCA>"There may be people left to evacuate."
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_026: I knew you'd say that.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_A_027: Good thing I already sent soldiers out to search\nthe area. C'mon, let's meet up with them!
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_001: Promised One. I swear to carry out your mission.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_002: <NCA>"Mu."
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_003: Is... Is this real?
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_004: It's really you! Oh, thank goodness you're alive!
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_005: I thought you were gone forever...
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_006: <NCA>"What's this about my mission?"
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_007: Well. The world may be a safer place without\nBalor in it.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_008: But without a savior, I figured the number of people\nstruggling and suffering would grow.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_009: And that's why...I decided to set out and try to\nhelp people.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_010: I thought that's what you would do after the war.\nSorry, "mission" might have been presumptuous...
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_011: <NCA>"You know me better than I do."
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_012: <NCB>"I had the same thought."
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_013: Knew it!
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_014: Are you planning to head out now? Come on,\nlet's go!
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_015: <NCA>"There's no rush."
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_016: <NCB>"Aren't there people waiting for you?"
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_017: <ACA>I'm not rushing! I just made up my mind already!
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_018: <ACB>Eh, they'll be fine! I want to help you, Promised One.\nI made up my mind!
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_019: This is going to be waaay better than if I went to\na temple.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_020: I'm fulfilling my dream. What could be more\nimportant than that?
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_021: <RSDS>Besides, we were only just reunited. I'd hate to\nget separated so soon.
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_022: We've come so far together. I just want to keep\nfighting for people in need...
MID_SE_Ism_Moo_S_023: and for you.